{"id": "68418", "title": "此情可待", "author": "清水白", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68418.htm", "intro": "他出生在家风严谨的军人世家，拥有傲人的家世，英俊的外表，出众的能力，是女孩眼中的金龟婿，却独独对部下的青梅情有独钟，心生好感\r\n\r\n　　 一个随心所遇的女孩子，在风雨的路上边走边爱，有过情殇，却依然在心底坚守着爱的信念，风雨的磨难她是否能够浴火重生，化茧为蝶？　\r\n　 　　　　\r\n　　　　 一场阴差阳错的宿命纠葛却将他们紧紧缠绕在一起。这是命运的宽容，还是又一次不怀好意的玩笑......当命运的曲线徘徊在十字路口，他们之间是离，是散？相爱的人是否能够走到永远？携手白老", "base": "files/article/html/68/68418", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子（可跳过）", "file": "10528278.html", "available": false}, {"title": "未婚妈妈[--]（小修）", "file": "10528279.html", "available": false}, {"title": "未婚妈妈[二](小修）", "file": "10528280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天伦心犀[一]", "file": "10528281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天伦心犀[二]", "file": "10528282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "天伦心犀[三]", "file": "10528283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "灯火阑珊处一（修）", "file": "10528284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "灯火阑珊处[二]", "file": "10528285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "那些年华[一]", "file": "10528286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "那些年华[二]", "file": "10528287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "风起", "file": "10528288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雨落[一]", "file": "10528289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雨落[二]", "file": "10528290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "往事如风(修）", "file": "10528291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "才下眉头", "file": "10528292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "却上心头", "file": "10528293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "夜凉如许", "file": "10528294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温情生日", "file": "10528295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "点滴关怀", "file": "10528296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "延绵不绝(修）", "file": "10528297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "悲伤逆流", "file": "10528298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "殇字心头", "file": "10528299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "酒情真露", "file": "10528300.html", "available": false